{"seq":3,"slug":"spectral-conflict","title":"频谱冲突解决与多轨 EQ 策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mixing-engineering/frequency-balance/spectral-conflict","wordCount":1402,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"频谱冲突解决与多轨-eq-策略\">频谱冲突解决与多轨 EQ 策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>当多个乐器在相同频段有显著能量时，会发生频率冲突（遮蔽）。解决冲突的核心不是&quot;一切一加&quot;地乱动 EQ，而是先判断哪个乐器在该频段更重要，再让次要方让位。本篇给出一套系统方法：从冲突诊断、互补 EQ、动态 EQ/频段侧链，到&quot;由粗到精&quot;的多轨 EQ 工作流，并附何时切、何时加的决策矩阵。</p>\n<h2 id=\"频率冲突的诊断方法\">频率冲突的诊断方法</h2><p>当多个乐器在相同频率区间有显著能量时，频率冲突（Frequency Masking/Clashing）发生。诊断的第一步是识别哪些乐器对在哪个频段发生碰撞。</p>\n<p>系统化诊断流程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>冲突严重度</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msubsup><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{冲突严重度} = \\frac{\\int_{f_1}^{f_2} |A(f)| \\cdot |B(f)|\\ df}{\\int_{f_1}^{f_2} \\max(|A(f)|, |B(f)|)\\ df}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">冲突严重度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.3519em;vertical-align:-1.4259em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.9259em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.044em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.044em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3442em;margin-left:-0.1945em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2579em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4919em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">df</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.274em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.044em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.9259em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.044em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.044em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3442em;margin-left:-0.1945em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2579em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4919em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">df</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4259em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>值接近 1 表示两个乐器在该频段高度重叠。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>诊断方法</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>发现什么</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Solo 对比</td>\n<td>交替 Solo 两轨</td>\n<td>哪个更重要</td>\n<td>快速判断优先级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mute 法</td>\n<td>静音怀疑轨</td>\n<td>是否更清晰</td>\n<td>确认冲突存在</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频段 Solo</td>\n<td>窄带 BP 扫频</td>\n<td>冲突频点</td>\n<td>精确定位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频谱叠加</td>\n<td>两轨频谱重叠显示</td>\n<td>重叠区间</td>\n<td>视觉直观</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>侧链检测</td>\n<td>A 的频谱作为 B 的遮蔽曲线</td>\n<td>被遮蔽量</td>\n<td>量化分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>常见冲突对及解决方向：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>冲突对</th>\n<th>冲突频段</th>\n<th>主导乐器</th>\n<th>让位乐器</th>\n<th>建议操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Kick vs Bass</td>\n<td>60–150 Hz</td>\n<td>看风格</td>\n<td>另一个</td>\n<td>互补 EQ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vocal vs Guitar</td>\n<td>1–3 kHz</td>\n<td>Vocal</td>\n<td>Guitar</td>\n<td>Guitar 切凹</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Snare vs Vocal</td>\n<td>200–400 Hz</td>\n<td>Vocal</td>\n<td>Snare</td>\n<td>Snare 切浑浊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Piano vs Guitar</td>\n<td>500–2 kHz</td>\n<td>看编曲</td>\n<td>次要方</td>\n<td>频率分区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bass vs Synth Pad</td>\n<td>100–300 Hz</td>\n<td>Bass</td>\n<td>Pad</td>\n<td>Pad HPF 高切</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    A[&quot;识别冲突&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;确定优先级&lt;br/&gt;哪个乐器更重要&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C{&quot;解决策略&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;频率让位&quot;| D[&quot;次要乐器&lt;br/&gt;在冲突频段切凹&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;互补 EQ&quot;| E[&quot;A 切 B 加&lt;br/&gt;各据频段&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;动态规避&quot;| F[&quot;侧链触发&lt;br/&gt;在 A 响时 B 让&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;空间分离&quot;| G[&quot;Pan/深度&lt;br/&gt;不同位置&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; H[&quot;重新评估平衡&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H\">flowchart TB\n    A[\"识别冲突\"] --&gt; B[\"确定优先级&lt;br/&gt;哪个乐器更重要\"]\n    B --&gt; C{\"解决策略\"}\n    C --&gt;|\"频率让位\"| D[\"次要乐器&lt;br/&gt;在冲突频段切凹\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"互补 EQ\"| E[\"A 切 B 加&lt;br/&gt;各据频段\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"动态规避\"| F[\"侧链触发&lt;br/&gt;在 A 响时 B 让\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"空间分离\"| G[\"Pan/深度&lt;br/&gt;不同位置\"]\n    D --&gt; H[\"重新评估平衡\"]\n    E --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"互补-eq-策略\">互补 EQ 策略</h2><p>互补均衡（Complementary EQ）是解决两轨频率冲突的经典方法：在乐器 A 需要的频段给 A 加，同时在相同频段给 B 切；在 B 需要的频段做相反操作。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> 在冲突区间应避免同时大于 1</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_A(f) \\cdot H_B(f) \\text{ 在冲突区间应避免同时大于 1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">在冲突区间应避免同时大于</span><span class=\"mord\"> 1</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Kick 与 Bass 的经典互补策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>Kick 主频</th>\n<th>Bass 主频</th>\n<th>核心操作</th>\n<th>音乐风格</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Kick 低 + Bass 高</td>\n<td>50–60 Hz Boost</td>\n<td>80–120 Hz Boost</td>\n<td>Kick 80 Cut, Bass 50 Cut</td>\n<td>Rock/Metal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kick 高 + Bass 低</td>\n<td>80–100 Hz Boost</td>\n<td>40–60 Hz Boost</td>\n<td>反向</td>\n<td>Hip-Hop/EDM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频率共存</td>\n<td>60–80 Hz 共享</td>\n<td>同频段</td>\n<td>侧链压缩分时</td>\n<td>Funk/Pop</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实施互补 EQ 的量化方法：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>如果 </mtext><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mtext> dB</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> 则 </mtext><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mtext> dB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{如果 } H_A(f_0) = +3\\ \\text{dB}, \\text{ 则 } H_B(f_0) \\leq -3\\ \\text{dB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">如果</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dB</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">则</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dB</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这不是硬性公式，而是指导方向——重点是两个乐器在冲突频段不同时&quot;争抢&quot;听者注意力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Kick[&quot;Kick EQ&quot;]&#10;        K1[&quot;60 Hz Boost +4&quot;]&#10;        K2[&quot;200 Hz Cut -3&quot;]&#10;        K3[&quot;3 kHz Boost +2&lt;br/&gt;Attack&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Bass[&quot;Bass EQ&quot;]&#10;        B1[&quot;60 Hz Cut -2&quot;]&#10;        B2[&quot;200 Hz Boost +3&lt;br/&gt;Warmth&quot;]&#10;        B3[&quot;1 kHz Boost +2&lt;br/&gt;Definition&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    K1 -.-&gt;|&quot;互补&quot;| B1&#10;    K2 -.-&gt;|&quot;互补&quot;| B2\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Kick[\"Kick EQ\"]\n        K1[\"60 Hz Boost +4\"]\n        K2[\"200 Hz Cut -3\"]\n        K3[\"3 kHz Boost +2&lt;br/&gt;Attack\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Bass[\"Bass EQ\"]\n        B1[\"60 Hz Cut -2\"]\n        B2[\"200 Hz Boost +3&lt;br/&gt;Warmth\"]\n        B3[\"1 kHz Boost +2&lt;br/&gt;Definition\"]\n    end\n    K1 -.-&gt;|\"互补\"| B1\n    K2 -.-&gt;|\"互补\"| B2</pre><h2 id=\"动态-eq-与频段侧链\">动态 EQ 与频段侧链</h2><p>当频率冲突仅在特定时刻发生（如 Kick 击打瞬间与 Bass 碰撞，但 Kick 间隙时 Bass 不需让位），静态 EQ 过于粗暴——它一直在切割。动态 EQ（Dynamic EQ）和多频段侧链压缩可以实现&quot;按需让位&quot;。</p>\n<p>动态 EQ 的工作模式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>Threshold</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mtext> dB</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>otherwise</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G(f_0, t) = \\begin{cases} G_{target} &amp; \\text{if } |X(f_0, t)| &gt; \\text{Threshold} \\\\ 0\\ \\text{dB} &amp; \\text{otherwise} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dB</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Threshold</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">otherwise</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实际上使用平滑的 Attack/Release 包络，不是硬切换。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>工作方式</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>动态 EQ (内部触发)</td>\n<td>自身超阈值时增减</td>\n<td>精确频段控制</td>\n<td>响应可能慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态 EQ (外部侧链)</td>\n<td>其他信号触发</td>\n<td>完美同步</td>\n<td>设置复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多频段压缩</td>\n<td>分频后独立压缩</td>\n<td>全频段保护</td>\n<td>分频点染色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>侧链压缩 (全频段)</td>\n<td>外部触发全频压缩</td>\n<td>简单有效</td>\n<td>过于粗暴</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>侧链压缩 (频段)</td>\n<td>外部触发特定频段</td>\n<td>最精确</td>\n<td>CPU 开销高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>典型应用——Kick 侧链触发 Bass 低频动态 EQ：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Bass</mtext><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi>H</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mtext> dB</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>Kick 击打时</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mtext> dB</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>Kick 间隙时</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Bass}_{60Hz}(t) = \\begin{cases} -4\\ \\text{dB} &amp; \\text{Kick 击打时} \\\\ 0\\ \\text{dB} &amp; \\text{Kick 间隙时} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bass</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">60</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dB</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dB</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Kick </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">击打时</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Kick </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">间隙时</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这样 Bass 仅在 Kick 实际发声的那几十毫秒内在 60 Hz 让位，其余时间保持完整的低频能量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;Kick 信号&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;侧链输入&quot;| B[&quot;Dynamic EQ&lt;br/&gt;on Bass&quot;]&#10;    C[&quot;Bass 信号&quot;] --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; D{&quot;Kick 响时&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| E[&quot;Bass 60 Hz&lt;br/&gt;衰减 -4 dB&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| F[&quot;Bass 正常&lt;br/&gt;0 dB&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;输出&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"Kick 信号\"] --&gt;|\"侧链输入\"| B[\"Dynamic EQ&lt;br/&gt;on Bass\"]\n    C[\"Bass 信号\"] --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; D{\"Kick 响时\"}\n    D --&gt;|\"是\"| E[\"Bass 60 Hz&lt;br/&gt;衰减 -4 dB\"]\n    D --&gt;|\"否\"| F[\"Bass 正常&lt;br/&gt;0 dB\"]\n    E --&gt; G[\"输出\"]\n    F --&gt; G</pre><h2 id=\"多轨-eq-工作流总结\">多轨 EQ 工作流总结</h2><p>完整的多轨频率平衡工作流应遵循&quot;由粗到精&quot;的策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>工具选择</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1. 清理</td>\n<td>每轨 HPF + 明显问题切除</td>\n<td>去除无用频率</td>\n<td>HPF + Notch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. 粗调</td>\n<td>建立整体频率分布</td>\n<td>各组频段定位</td>\n<td>Shelf + Wide Bell</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. 精修</td>\n<td>解决具体冲突</td>\n<td>乐器对清晰度</td>\n<td>Narrow Cut + 动态 EQ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. 增强</td>\n<td>突出乐器特征</td>\n<td>美学提升</td>\n<td>Wide Boost</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5. 检查</td>\n<td>A/B 参考对比</td>\n<td>确认方向正确</td>\n<td>Bypass + 参考</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键决策矩阵——何时切（Subtractive）何时加（Additive）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情况</th>\n<th>推荐</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>消除嗡鸣/共振</td>\n<td>减法（窄切）</td>\n<td>问题明确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增加&quot;存在感&quot;</td>\n<td>加法（宽提升）</td>\n<td>增强自然特征</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>为其他乐器让位</td>\n<td>减法（中等切）</td>\n<td>不改变自身音色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整体变亮/变暗</td>\n<td>Shelf 加法</td>\n<td>自然倾向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>母带微调</td>\n<td>加法为主</td>\n<td>幅度小更自然</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>最终检验:</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>Bypass 所有 EQ</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>重新开启</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>改善必须可闻</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{最终检验:} \\quad \\text{Bypass 所有 EQ} \\to \\text{重新开启} \\to \\text{改善必须可闻}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最终检验</span><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bypass </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">所有</span><span class=\"mord\"> EQ</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">重新开启</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">改善必须可闻</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>如果 Bypass 时混音并未明显变差，该 EQ 操作可能是不必要的——应该移除以减少相位累积和处理复杂度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    A[&quot;原始多轨&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Phase 1: 清理&lt;br/&gt;HPF + Notch&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Phase 2: 粗调&lt;br/&gt;频段划分&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Phase 3: 精修&lt;br/&gt;解决冲突&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;Phase 4: 增强&lt;br/&gt;特征突出&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;Phase 5: 检查&lt;br/&gt;A/B 参考&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;不满意&quot;| C&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;满意&quot;| G[&quot;进入动态处理&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    A[\"原始多轨\"] --&gt; B[\"Phase 1: 清理&lt;br/&gt;HPF + Notch\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Phase 2: 粗调&lt;br/&gt;频段划分\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Phase 3: 精修&lt;br/&gt;解决冲突\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"Phase 4: 增强&lt;br/&gt;特征突出\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"Phase 5: 检查&lt;br/&gt;A/B 参考\"]\n    F --&gt;|\"不满意\"| C\n    F --&gt;|\"满意\"| G[\"进入动态处理\"]</pre><h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../frequency-balance/spectral-analysis\">频率分布认知与频谱分析</a>：本篇冲突诊断的声学根因（向上遮蔽、临界频带），在该篇有完整心理声学基础。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../frequency-balance/eq-types\">均衡器类型与参数精解</a>：本篇互补 EQ 与动态 EQ 用到的滤波器形状与参数，在该篇逐一精解。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../dynamics-processing/compressor-fundamentals\">压缩器原理与参数精解</a>：本篇频段侧链与&quot;按需让位&quot;依赖压缩器的阈值/侧链机制，该篇是其前置原理。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../audio-signal-processing/audio-effects/eq-filters\">音频效果中的 EQ 与滤波器</a>（音频信号处理）：动态 EQ 的包络跟随实现，在此从 DSP 角度补充。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"频谱冲突解决与多轨 EQ 策略","id":"频谱冲突解决与多轨-eq-策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"频率冲突的诊断方法","id":"频率冲突的诊断方法"},{"level":2,"text":"互补 EQ 策略","id":"互补-eq-策略"},{"level":2,"text":"动态 EQ 与频段侧链","id":"动态-eq-与频段侧链"},{"level":2,"text":"多轨 EQ 工作流总结","id":"多轨-eq-工作流总结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"均衡器类型与参数精解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mixing-engineering/frequency-balance/eq-types"},"next":{"title":"压缩器原理与参数精解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mixing-engineering/dynamics-processing/compressor-fundamentals"}}